{"title":"Copperhead","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 19 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .25 | venomDamage: 8 | venomDurationMs: 4e3</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-0.7px,-729.7px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/-1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/-1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><i style=\"left:-39.9px;top:708.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-52.3px;top:725.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-53.6px;top:723.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-68.7px;top:714.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-66.0px;top:712.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1.4px;top:727.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-1.4px;top:723.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:5.5px;top:743.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:53.6px;top:752.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:60.5px;top:754.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:53.6px;top:750.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-31.6px;top:746.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:125.1px;top:739.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:122.4px;top:743.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:52.3px;top:733.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:22.0px;top:728.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:31.6px;top:726.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:26.1px;top:727.4px\"></i></div><figcaption>Outrider C